{{Spell}}

==Details==
This spell is only available if you have {{ItemTooltip|The Accumulator}} equipped.

Multiplies profits by:
<br><math>(C + 1)^{0.8} \times I \times 0.5 + 1</math>


where:
* <math>C = \text{Ritual of Potency Real Casts This Exile}</math>
* <math>I = \text{Incantation Efficiency}</math>